==Trivia==
*Capsule Cat was formerly unlocked by inputting a [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] until the feature was removed in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].
*Capsule Cat's titular capsule is based off a [[wikipedia:Gashapon|Gachapon]] capsule.
*Cramped Cats is actually four cats: one of these is only visible in the unit's spritesheet.
*Capsule Cat's unit description received a change in BCEN [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].
*Cramped Cats' attack animation is bugged. If you look closely, you'll notice the shine effect from the capsule doesn't bounce alongside it during the attack animation.
*Not counting [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|Collaboration Cats]], Capsule Cat and [[Masked Cat (Special Cat)|Masked Cat]] are tied for the oldest existing Special Cats without [[True Form]]s.

